{
   "_readme": {
      "message": "Translator guide. Translate the 'message' value of every OTHER key into the target language. IGNORE this _readme key (do not translate it; it is never shown to users). Rules: (1) Keep emoji exactly where they appear. (2) Keep the * suffix on required-field labels. (3) Keep {count} and other {placeholders} unchanged. (4) Proper nouns marked in a key's 'description' as TRANSLITERATE must be written in the target script by SOUND, not translated by meaning (e.g. Srivani, Seva, Gothram, Darshan, Laddu, Abhishekam). (5) Keep the app name 'TTD Autofill Assistant' as-is. Chrome message keys (the left-hand identifiers) must never change."
   },
